{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/788894-changeling-1st-edition-cantrip-system","id":788894,"title":"Changeling 1st Edition Cantrip System","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-18T11:54:34-08:00","id":788894,"title":"Changeling 1st Edition Cantrip System","content":"Hi peoples,<br /> <br /> I've recently heard about the system of cantrip&amp;bunk of the first edition of the Dreaming who used a special deck of cards instead of dices, and I wanted to know more about it. Sadly, the internet is pretty stingy about this kind of ancient system. Could someone explain it to me please?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/822-daemonchrno","name":"DaemonChrno","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"118"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-19T05:04:21-08:00","id":789206,"title":"","content":"1. You have 1 card for every realm level and art level your PC knows.<br /> 2. You have 1 bunk card for every art dot your PC has.<br /> 3. Choose an effect (Art Card).<br /> 4. Choose a target or a Combination (Realm card).<br /> 5. Draw a random Bunk Card. You may draw an aditional bunk card spending 1 Glamour point.<br /> 6. If your PC performs the Bunk, she scores a number of successes displayed in the bunk card. If the target is human or you have mundane audience, you need to roll the realm ability and art attribute (difficulty of target's banality). The number of sucesses is limited to the number of successes on the bunk card.<br /> 7. You discard 1 of the cards involved at the end or you can spend 1 glamour point to avoid this loss.<br /> <br /> I hope this helps you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5821-neon-sidhe","name":"Neon.Sidhe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5821_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}